Z||000000||HummelHund||07-31-2001||12:32 PM||||It's raining and I can't work on my car. So, while waiting out the rain, I wrote a song in tribute to my favorite little '84 SE.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>My Fiero by Sean Wilson<P>Flames behind me and a four on the floor,<BR>Iron Duke, can you ask for much more?,<BR>Yeah, that's my Fiero, woooo<BR>Don't you know I can't ask for more?<P>She's got an engine that's too sweet,<BR>Two seats and a gas tank 'tween the seats,<BR>Yeah, that's my Fiero, woooo<BR>Don't you know she's too sweet?<P>Yeah, my Fiero's a bomb waiting to go off,<BR>Send a rod right through the block, you'd better not scoff,<BR>Yeah, that's my Fiero, woooo<BR>Don't you know she might go off?<P>Zero to sixty in a minute or two,<BR>Can she do 80?, I haven't a clue,<BR>Yeah, that's my Fiero, woooo<BR>Don't you know I'm stuck like glue?<P>You know I work on her baby, she still don't run,<BR>But I lose lots of blood, ain't that fun?<BR>Yeah that's my Fiero, woooo<BR>Don't you know I'm having too much fun?<P>She's got ninety-four horses, and not much more,<BR>Buy a faster 'mower at the hardware store,<BR>Yeah that's my Fiero, woooo<BR>Don't you know I can't ask for more?<P>I think I've got a record contract coming, what do you think? B)<P><P>------------------<BR>Sean W.<BR>'84 SE 2M4 WS6, The "Buzz Bomb". (restoration project to become daily driver)<BR>'84 Sport Coupe, The "Black Wedge of Death" ($150 running car)||||reg||6
Z||000001||Standard||07-31-2001||01:10 PM||||hehehe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>made me chuckle<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">        <BR>1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed<P><FONT SIZE="1">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto<BR><FONT COLOR="red">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cheever2||07-31-2001||06:14 PM||||I'm planning a Fiero poetry contest for the Houston New Years Eve event.  Anybody who's planning to come should start writing theirs now!<BR><P>------------------<BR>- <I>Chuck Hodges</I> -<BR><A HREF="http://home.houston.rr.com/fieropartsrelay" TARGET=_blank> Fiero Parts Relay</A> administrator||||reg||1
Z||000003||88CoupeV6||07-31-2001||07:07 PM||||I did that. I rewrote the lyrics to "I want to drive the zamboni"    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>You should download the song and sing along.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> You can use <A HREF="http://www.aimster.com" TARGET=_blank>www.aimster.com</A> <P><B>   Well I went on down to the Pontiac dealer, asked to see the manager man.  He came from his office, said, "Son, can I help you?"  I looked at him and said, "Yes you can.  I want to drive a Fiero.  I want to drive a Fi-e-ro, yes I do."<P>   Now ever since I was young it's been my dream that I might drive a fiero GT.  I'd get that rice to hide from me, and all the kids would look up to me.  Yeah I want to drive a Fiero.  I want to drive a Fi-e-ro, yes I do.<P>   Now the manager said, "Son I know it looks keen, but that Fiero's one expensive machine.  And I've had it here for about 13 years."  About that time I broke down in tears.  'Cuz I want to drive a Fiero.  I want to drive a Fi-e-ro.  Yeah I want to drive a Fiero.  I want to drive a Fi-e-ro, yes I do.</B><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">     <BR><B>Also 88 Yellow GT</B>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A><p>[This message has been edited by 88CoupeV6 (edited 07-31-2001).]||||reg||7
